  "ingredients": [
    "0.25 cup unsalted butter",
    "0.25 cup olive oil",
    "3 cups diced mushrooms",
    "1 cup chopped onion",
    "1 sprig rosemary",
    "1.5 cups Arborio rice",
    "0.75 cup white wine",
    "1 quart chicken stock",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste",
    "0.5 cup grated Parmesan cheese"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Turn on a multi-functional pressure cooker (such as Instant Pot) and select Sauté function. Add butter and olive oil; stir until butter melts, about 2 minutes. Add mushrooms; cook, stirring occasionally, until slightly softened, about 3 minutes. Stir in onion; cook for 2 minutes. Add rosemary sprig; cook for 1 minute.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/GOKchcp9vruRv8Xwv3_rQW0Obto=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/259455-instant-pot-mushroom-risotto-ddmfs-4x3-step1-0081-73ad953af55d4d0e8a8b2275b67de352.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/259455/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir rice into the Pot until each grain is coated with butter and olive oil mixture, about 2 minutes. Pour in wine; simmer for 3 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5_yYA0xiLYmOPydHWNDya8YI8_M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/259455-instant-pot-mushroom-risotto-ddmfs-4x3-step2-0083-03c53aad097b4644b691ad35cb4ee66a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/259455/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour in stock, stirring to scrape the sides of the Pot; simmer for 1 minute.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/bf3Wk59lrbZh3iJcY8jknrGku7Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/259455-instant-pot-mushroom-risotto-ddmfs-4x3-step3-0084-66a293422e3345f19f23281242f3e6b2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/259455/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Close and lock the lid; turn the venting knob to sealing. Select high pressure according to manufacturer's instructions; set timer for 6 minutes. Allow 10 to 15 minutes for pressure to build.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Release pressure carefully using the quick-release method according to the manufacturer’s instructions, about 5 minutes. Unlock and remove the lid.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir risotto until creamy, about 1 minute. Discard rosemary sprig. Season with salt and black pepper; stir in Parmesan cheese until melted and combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lQjWY3KXocfcJuoLlQehqzpUWEA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/259455-instant-pot-mushroom-risotto-ddmfs-4x3-step4-0085-dbd25cd7bfb0495c95c676591f2b6ef3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/259455/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve hot and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
